# Exam track — Theme: Musek — Sub-lesson 2: Key Phrases
# Plain sentences (no @question): presented in either direction.
# Grounded in the user's real answers (rock/metal/folk, Spotify, headphones,
# no radio, Onuka/Go-A/Okean Elzy from Ukraine, ROME, Rock am Ring, wants to
# see Metallica/Rammstein/Muse live) — gathered by interview on 2026-09-01.
# Do not "improve" or genericize these in a later editing pass.

@lesson M1.02 "Music Phrases"

@word de Radio = the radio
@word de Kopfhörer = the headphones
@word d'CDen = the CDs
@word streamen = to stream
@word mëschen = to mix
@word recommandéieren = to recommend
@word d'Frënn = the friends
@word d'Energie = the energy
@word d'Bands = the bands
@word bekannt = well-known
@word live = live
@word wichteg = important
@word ëmmer = always
@word Englesch = English
@word Ukrainesch = Ukrainian

@sentence
@lu Musek ass wichteg fir mech, well se mir Energie gëtt.
@en Music is important to me, because it gives me energy.
@distractor-lu Reen
@distractor-lu Schoul
@distractor-en rain
@distractor-en school

@sentence
@lu Ech lauschtere Musek mat Kopfhörer, wann ech schaffen.
@en I listen to music with headphones when I work.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en TV

@sentence
@lu Am Auto lauschteren ech ëmmer Musek.
@en In the car I always listen to music.
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu seelen
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en rarely

@sentence
@lu Ech streame meng Musek op Spotify, ech kafe keng CDen.
@en I stream my music on Spotify, I don't buy CDs.
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-lu Reen
@distractor-en books
@distractor-en rain

@sentence
@lu Als Kand hunn ech Musek meeschtens am Radio gelauschtert.
@en As a child I mostly listened to music on the radio.
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-lu Schoul
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-en school

@sentence
@lu Ech lauschtere gär Musek op Englesch an op Ukrainesch.
@en I like listening to music in English and in Ukrainian.
@distractor-lu Spuenesch
@distractor-lu Portugisesch
@distractor-en Spanish
@distractor-en Portuguese

@sentence
@lu Nei Bands wéi Onuka a Go-A mësche Volleksmusek mat anere Genren.
@en New bands like Onuka and Go-A mix folk music with other genres.
@distractor-lu Concerten
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en concerts
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@lu ROME ass e bekannte Museker aus Lëtzebuerg.
@en ROME is a well-known musician from Luxembourg.
@distractor-lu Festival
@distractor-lu Auto
@distractor-en festival
@distractor-en car

@sentence
@lu Metallica a Rammstein wëll ech onbedéngt live gesinn.
@en I absolutely want to see Metallica and Rammstein live.
@distractor-lu kafen
@distractor-lu danzen
@distractor-en buy
@distractor-en dance

@sentence
@lu D'lescht Joer ware mir op engem Festival an Däitschland.
@en Last year we were at a festival in Germany.
@distractor-lu Schoul
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en school
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@lu Heiansdo recommandéiere Frënn mir nei Musek.
@en Sometimes friends recommend new music to me.
@distractor-lu Kassetten
@distractor-lu Reen
@distractor-en cassettes
@distractor-en rain
